      "name": "Season 2",
      "overview": "Picking up after the explosive events of season one, season two finds \"The Morning Show\" team emerging from the wreckage of Alex and Bradley's actions, to a new UBA and a world in flux, where identity is everything and the chasm between who we present as and who we really are comes into play.",
