    {
      "airDate": "2023-09-12",
      "episodeCount": 10,
      "name": "Season 3",
      "overview": "The future of the network is thrown into question and loyalties are pushed to the brink when a tech titan takes an interest in UBA. Unexpected alliances form, private truths are weaponized and everyone is forced to confront their core values both in and out of the newsroom.",
